# Jinja2

Use Jinja2 to generate code from a template.

## Usage

```sh
./jinja2 template.jinja2 input.txt
```

## Templates

Templates are stored in the `templates` folder.

## Output

Output files are stored in the `output` folder.

## Template Syntax

| Tag    | Description                                        |
|--------|----------------------------------------------------|
| <|user|> | Begin of user input                               |
| <|assistant|> | Begin of assistant input                         |
| <|system|> | Begin of system output                            |
| <|userInput|> | User input                                        |
| <|systemInput|> | System input                                     |
| <|userOutput|> | User output                                       |
| <|systemOutput|> | System output                                    |
| <|inputFile|> | Open a file for reading                          |
| <|userInputFile|> | Open user input file for reading                  |
| <|systemInputFile|> | Open system input file for reading               |
| <|outputFile|> | Open a file for writing                          |
| <|userOutputFile|> | Open user output file for writing                |
| <|systemOutputFile|> | Open system output file for writing             |
| <|endFile|> | Close a file                                     |
| <|userEndFile|> | Close a user input file                          |
