# Code-Block-Challenge

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

* [Java 8](https://www.java.com/en/download/)

### Installing

* Clone the repository and import the project into your IDE. To run the project, make sure the "Main" class is set as the main class.

## Running the Project

### Program

* The program will open up a window with the following buttons:

![Buttons](https://i.imgur.com/91U9K5L.png)

* The top button will take you to the main menu where you can choose the language you want to practice.
* The middle button will take you to the practice menu where you can choose which chapter you want to practice.
* The last button will take you to the result menu where you can see how well you did in the practice.

![Menus](https://i.imgur.com/7u288iH.png)

* In the main menu, you can choose the language you want to practice by clicking the respective button.

![Languages](https://i.imgur.com/7Z6y50N.png)

* In the practice menu, you can choose the chapter you want to practice by clicking the respective button.

![Chapters](https://i.imgur.com/i76d670.png)

* In the result menu, you can see the total score you got in the practice.

![Results](https://i.imgur.com/aZ17T7o.png)

* In the practice menu, you can choose the difficulty you want to practice

