EP is a program that generates code for a programmer who is an expert in Java.
It is based on the [Nashorn](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nashorn) JavaScript engine, which is part of the [Oracle JDK](http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/javase/downloads/index.html).

EP is a command-line tool, and it can be run as follows:

```
